  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2023 CORE SUPPORT TO GAVI VACCINE ALLIANCE 2021-2025 STRATEGY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gavi, The Vaccine Alliance is a public-private partnership committed to saving children&#x2019;s lives and protecting people&#x2019;s health by increasing access to immunisation in developing countries. Gavi&#x2019;s 5.0 strategy for the period 2021-2025 has four goals, each supporting its overall mission to save lives and protect people&#x2019;s health by increasing equitable and sustainable use of vaccines Ireland&apos;s funding addresses vaccine procurement efforts, including market-shaping efforts and supply-chain strengthening, strengthening health and immunization systems, the program implementation by Gavi partners and other cash programmes, mainly the Covid Delivery Systems and Middle Income Country support. The principle target group is children at risk of vaccine preventable diseases.</narrative>
  </description>
